schema RetentionRecord
generation control-1
authority engine/core/src/retention.c
absorbs components/BonfyreControlPlane/retention_gc.py.archive

field record_id
  type text
  role identity
  required true

field occurrence
  type text
  role occurrence-ref
  required true

field kind
  type enum
  values reaction presence chat utterance speaker topic entity place chapter clip_candidate cta claim sponsor_mention commerce
  required true
  note kind determines tier; callers may not select a weaker tier

field written_at
  type timestamp-ms
  required true

field body
  type text
  role material
  default ""

invariant body-and-history-are-distinct
  statement collection removes body only after its declared lifetime and all holds end, while retaining a tombstone for institutional history

invariant holds-outrank-clock
  statement an elapsed lifetime permits consideration only; an active named hold prevents collection

forbidden_inference elapsed lifetime -> permission to remove
forbidden_inference removed body -> occurrence did not happen
